you have what it takes to compete at the highest level?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/54e1e5911ad363b7016a885c22bb2297.poster.avif?t=1775663091\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/54e1e5911ad363b7016a885c22bb2297.webm?t=1775663091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/54e1e5911ad363b7016a885c22bb2297.mp4?t=1775663091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY A RICH, IMMERSIVE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cinematic rush every time you step onto the battlefield thanks to Predecessor's breath-taking visuals and sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy extraordinary graphical fidelity that pushes the limits of what a MOBA should look like, supported by awe-inspiring audio that lets you feel every explosion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/d0468eb4f1df4b64cfb66c058069b469.poster.avif?t=1775663091\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/d0468eb4f1df4b64cfb66c058069b469.webm?t=1775663091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/d0468eb4f1df4b64cfb66c058069b469.mp4?t=1775663091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIN YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other MOBAs, Predecessor puts you in control - literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and hit the couch, playing effortlessly against friends and enemies on keyboard and mouse thanks to full cross-play on console and PC with Discord-powered voice comms, ensuring you never miss a callout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up and play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/72a3b1591bc9417bfb01656b279f87f9.poster.avif?t=1775663091\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/72a3b1591bc9417bfb01656b279f87f9.webm?t=1775663091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/72a3b1591bc9417bfb01656b279f87f9.mp4?t=1775663091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOPED BY THE COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predecessor isn't just designed for the MOBA community, it's built <strong>by</strong> it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players drive Predecessor's development like no other game. Major decisions are polled, feedback dictates direction and transparency rules communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From our earliest days of being coded live on Twitch to being a global powerhouse in the MOBA genre, our community is at the heart of everything we do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961200/extras/ffc0e40d26ad1fd57937cb19a37b521d.poster.avif?t=1775663091\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/